# Analytics requirements

Every aggregate statistic must retain applicable dimensions: patch, platform/region, queue, rank tier, role, champion, opponent champion, sample size, last-updated timestamp.

Never present a statistic without its sample size. Do not claim collected matches represent all League matches.

Distinguish: lane advantage, overall matchup win rate, player-specific matchup performance, and global/peer-group matchup performance.

Treat patch comparisons as associations, not causal proof.
